        },
        "output_tokens": 344,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 270
        },
        "total_tokens": 5643,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 5299,
            "output_tokens": 344,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 270
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 5120
            },
            "total_tokens": 5643,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P03-S04-U15",
      "role": "client",
      "text": "其实……听你这么说，我也觉得今天来之前照那两次镜子，就是不想被人看见我哭过。好像哭这件事一旦被看见，我就连最后一点“我还能撑住”的样子也保不住了。不过现在被你说出来，我反而没那么想逃了。就到这里吧，我想先回去。",
      "request_sha256": "07381b5b89728ad374458731ea8f47edacd1b84d718a467b3badad5ab7d9a157",
      "usage": {
